--- stdout
This will tear down app "shop" on https://cp.example: every hosted environment is deleted.
  ENV       ID         DEPLOYMENTS   CUSTOM DOMAINS
  prod      env_prod   2             shop.example
  staging   env_stg    2             none
--- error
the control plane refuses to delete an env while a custom domain is bound to it, so nothing was deleted
fix: unbind each (the domains stay in your organization), then re-run `forge app teardown`:
    forge domain unbind shop.example --env prod
